{"title":"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Check\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Check</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The mean, median, and mode of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> data values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/9/9890cf93e5ac17f6c4cfed3fa7a00cf9152ae34b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60, 100, x, 40, 50, 200, 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"185\" height=\"16\" /> are all equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/a/d0aca6baa162cfb74364f302225c0b10ce0b27e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 50 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 60 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 75 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 90 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"403\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the mean,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/6/db6cdf1e2ce5c40061c734f8cc44d1faede06150.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x&amp;=\\frac{60+100+x+40+50+200+90}{7}\\\\ &amp;=\\frac{540+x}{7}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"307\" height=\"80\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/9852a1483ce904f4adef62321dd6ed5002f8504c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x=540+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76c643792d2a5fb493fe7c6ff6a9bf9eb79f3bfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }90}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"103\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>Note: if the mean of a set is in the set, it can be discarded and the mean of the remaining numbers will be the same. This means that if using the mean in your reasoning, you can just take the mean of the other 6 numbers, and it'll solve it marginally faster. -<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Integralarefun\" title=\"User:Integralarefun\">Integralarefun</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User_talk:Integralarefun\" title=\"User talk:Integralarefun\">talk</a>) 18:19, 27 September 2023 (EDT)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be the median so it must equal either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. You can see that the mean is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, and by intuition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> should be the greater one. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76c643792d2a5fb493fe7c6ff6a9bf9eb79f3bfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }90}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"103\" height=\"28\" />\n~bjc\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Check\">Check</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Check\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Order the list: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/5/945841734d86499e02222d732d142ace376f43ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{40,50,60,90,100,200\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> because it is both the median and the mode of the set. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is correct.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qDqe8pztaJQ\">https://youtu.be/qDqe8pztaJQ</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/XXX4_oBHuGk?t=163\">https://youtu.be/XXX4_oBHuGk?t=163</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/joLWmbpvrCw\">https://youtu.be/joLWmbpvrCw</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A\">2016 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a